OL,3,GNEWSALaw Society CEO found 'guilty of
OL,4,Agross misconduct'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Law Society chief executive has
OL,7,Fbeen found "guilty of gross misconduct"
OL,8,Ffollowing a character reference he
OL,9,Fprovided to a cousin convicted of
OL,10,Fserious sexual offences.
OL,12,FDavid Lavery had provided a character
OL,13,Freference to a court after the
OL,14,Fconviction of former schoolteacher
OL,15,FWilliam Lloyd-Lavery.
OL,17,FThe Law Society said an independent
OL,18,Fdisciplinary panel "determined that the
OL,19,Fappropriate sanction that the Chief
OL,20,FExecutive received a sanction short of
OL,21,Fdismissal".
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
